{
 "id": "create:basin",
 "schematic": "basin",
 "schematicNamespace": "create",
 "title": "Processing Items in the Basin",
 "texts": {
  "text_1": "A Basin can hold Items and Fluids for Processing",
  "text_2": "After a processing step, basins try to output below to the side of them",
  "text_3": "When a valid component is present, the Basin will show an output faucet",
  "text_4": "A number of options are applicable here",
  "text_5": "Outputs will be caught by the inventory below",
  "text_6": "Without output faucet, the Basin will retain items created in its processing",
  "text_7": "This can be useful if outputs should be re-used as ingredients",
  "text_8": "Desired outputs will then have to be extracted from the basin",
  "text_9": "A Filter might be necessary to avoid pulling out un-processed items"
 },
